 "type": "fyo:ComparisonRecord",
 "title": {
  "zh": "四族源的功率账：NBI 注入 = 吸收 + 穿透 + 首轨损失、LH 耦合 = 沉积、EC 发射 = 吸收 + 出逃 + 未追、IC 剖面 = 注入——四族都闭合到舍入",
  "en": "The power account of all four source families: NBI injected = absorbed + shine-through + first-orbit loss, LH coupled = deposited, EC launched = absorbed + escaped + untraced, IC profile = injected — all four close to round-off"
 },
 "domain": "tr-sources",
 "requirement": [
  "FR-TR-004",
  "NR-TR-001"
 ],
 "comparison_kind": "verification",
 "overall_verdict": "pass",
 "compared_subject": {
  "type": "spo:Code",
  "name": "fylite · code/beam · code/wave · code/rf_ray（经树门）；IC 在内核 heating::icrh_profile",
  "comment": "NBI 与 LH 在 EAST #137985 t = 4.041 s 的 KEFIT 平衡上（CASE-23），EC 在 CFEDR 20 MA 上（CASE-21）；剖面为给定式"
 },
 "compared_reference": [
  {
   "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
   "name": "抄录的判据：「P_inj = P_abs + P_shine + P_orbit 逐项闭合为可测不变量」（源族表）·「源沉积积分必须闭合到注入额定值」（NR-TR-001）",
   "comment": "★判据是恒等式，不要参考码：账闭合是每一扇门对自己输出的自证。"
  }
 ],
 "criteria": [
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/1",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "NBI：注入 = 吸收 + 穿透 + 首轨损失；沉积剖面体积分 = 吸收",
   "norm": "relative",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported",
   "tolerance": {
    "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
    "numeric_value": 1e-12
   },
   "comment": "★两束都设成穿透与首轨损失**都带功率**（反向束近边）——某个汇为零时闭合，那个汇就没被验到。"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/2",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "LH：耦合（发射 − 反射）= 吸收 = 沉积 = ∫p dV，逐天线与总和",
   "norm": "relative",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported",
   "tolerance": {
    "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
    "numeric_value": 1e-12
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/3",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "EC：发射 = 吸收 + 出逃 + 未追；各壳 + 壳外 = 吸收；功率密度 × 壳体积 = 壳功率",
   "norm": "relative",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported",
   "tolerance": {
    "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
    "numeric_value": 1e-09
   },
   "comment": "★1e-9 是内核自己这道门的带（沿射线的积分，舍入会累积）。"
  },
  {
   "id": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/4",
   "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
   "quantity_label": "IC：剖面对体积分 = 给定功率（总量与离子份额）",
   "norm": "relative",
   "tolerance_basis": "reference_self_reported",
   "tolerance": {
    "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
    "numeric_value": 1e-12
   },
   "comment": "★判的是内核函数 `icrh_profile`（门 `code/icrh` 用它铺剖面，门级的两道之和 = 吸收另由 `tr-sources-icrh-metis` 守）；门是内核仓的 Rust 单测。"
  }
 ],
 "findings": [
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "NBI 闭合：0.0e+00；穿透 87905 W、首轨损失 59086 W",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/1",
   "bound": "upper",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "deviation_literal": "注入 3500000 W = 吸收 3353009.5 + 穿透 87904.6 + 首轨损失 59085.9（相对 0.0e+00）；剖面体积分对吸收 0.0e+00；注入对声明 0.0e+00",
   "measured_deviation": 0.0,
   "caveat": [
    "★**恰为 0 是构造使然**：门把吸收定义为沉积剖面的壳和（`p_absorbed = shell_sum(p_dep, dV)`），穿透与首轨损失按分量记账——所以这一格守的是**构造**：哪天有人把某一项算在账外，它当场红。它不量数值误差。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "LH 闭合：0.0e+00（两天线、一路带反射）",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/2",
   "bound": "upper",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "deviation_literal": "耦合 2300000 W = 吸收 2300000 = 沉积 2300000；∫p dV 对沉积 0.0e+00；逐天线和 0.0e+00；驱动电流 572241 A",
   "measured_deviation": 0.0,
   "caveat": [
    "★同样是构造性的零。★LH 另有一种合法的「不闭合」：单程找不到共振时门报 `deposited = 0`、不沉积——那是可及性判据在起作用，内核门 `test_a_strict_single_pass_finds_no_resonance_and_says_so` 守它；本格的设置选在会沉积的一侧。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "EC 闭合：1.2e-14；壳账 4.4e-16",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/3",
   "bound": "upper",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "deviation_literal": "发射 6000000 W = 吸收 6000000.000000 + 出逃 3.5e-10 + 未追 0（相对 1.2e-14）；壳 + 壳外（0 W）对吸收 4.4e-16；p_e × V 对壳功率 1.1e-16",
   "measured_deviation": 1.2434497875801753e-14
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "IC 剖面闭合：4.4e-16",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/tr-sources-power-closure/criterion/4",
   "bound": "upper",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "deviation_literal": "总量 4.4e-16 · 离子份额 6.7e-16（内核测试打印，`hcd_metis_kernel.json`）",
   "measured_deviation": 6.661e-16
  }
 ],
 "validity_domain": "NBI：两束（同向 65 keV 2 MW 三分量、反向 80 keV 1.5 MW 近边），METIS 阻止本领；LH：4.6 GHz 1.5 MW（反射 0.1 MW）与 2.45 GHz 0.8 MW，eta_cd 1e19，upshift 1.5–2.5；二者都在 EAST #137985 t = 4.041 s KEFIT 平衡上、给定剖面（ne 4e19 (1 − 0.8 x²)，Te 2.5 keV (1 − 0.9 x²) + 50 eV，Zeff 1.5 + x²）。EC：CFEDR 20 MA、TORAY 那一束（O 支，deposit）。IC：内核测试的非平坦 V′ 与 4 / 3 MW。",
 "caveat": [
  "★★**账闭合不证物理**：把全部功率放在轴上的模型，账一样闭合。沉积位置与驱动效率由本域其余各条判（EC 对 TORAY、ECCD 与 ICRH 对 METIS、NBI 出生对 NUBEAM、LH 位置对 GENRAY）。"
 ],
